  "problem": "Enabled machine features lacked actual cross-transport evidence. Positive paths could use made-up schema IDs. Protocol success could be treated as research success. Browser unavailability could be recorded as passed. A transport discrepancy could be ignored if each transport passed its own producer tests. HTTP 200 or a successful tool envelope could be treated as a completed research task.",
